{"overview":"Asta and Yuno are two orphans who want the same thing: to become the Wizard King. Locked in a friendly rivalry, they work hard towards their goal. While Yuno excels at magic, Asta has a problem uncommon in this world: he has no powers! But, on the day they receive their grimoires, they surprise everyone. To reach their goal, they’ll each find their own path to greatness—with or without magic.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2016,"poster":"/xme6CwrPdAlDMkIMbYDvvm0r46H.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":170,"y":2017,"poster":"/7HQ4OCKkoI8YAYtl1vYnQ4mdGD4.jpg"}],"episodes":170,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"گاکوتو کاجیوارا","role":"Asta (voice)","photo":"/kUer38jXf7vTD2TGGxJMZVYL5Te.jpg","en":"Gakuto Kajiwara"},{"name":"島﨑信長","role":"Yuno (voice)","photo":"/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg","en":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"},{"name":"優木かな","role":"Noelle Silva (voice)","photo":"/gnKY83EbfaJWi1y47dgOtiRegAK.jpg","en":"Kana Yuuki"},{"name":"جونیچی سووابه","role":"Yami Sukehiro (voice)","photo":"/4S7c3n3r07A83HvkLrnWZGVhiHg.jpg","en":"Junichi Suwabe"},{"name":"室元気","role":"Magna Swing (voice)","photo":"/6YF881kJuP2HaSb5PXRO4hWTZA.jpg","en":"Genki Muro"},{"name":"村瀬歩","role":"Luck Voltia (voice)","photo":"/3aGM6KpcCIEKOXP9510tzaKc8uw.jpg","en":"Ayumu Murase"},{"name":"福山潤","role":"Finral Roulacase (voice)","photo":"/eT9eloyIaIkTvTqMmpcsAleP2hM.jpg","en":"Jun Fukuyama"},{"name":"日野聡","role":"Gauche Adlai (voice)","photo":"/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg","en":"Satoshi Hino"},{"name":"安野希世乃","role":"Charmy Papittoson (voice)","photo":"/n9TvLOSIqi6Pi4GlvH3fddNNsEG.jpg","en":"Kiyono Yasuno"},{"name":"水樹奈々","role":"Vanessa Enoteca (voice)","photo":"/rQBo7HyjTIqeB7hIofb7uJFhiVs.jpg","en":"Nana Mizuki"},{"name":"髙橋ミナミ","role":"Grey (voice)","photo":"/9SRX6yrHGtGEJxcnLyGFhOZkXSH.jpg","en":"Minami Takahashi"},{"name":"赤坂柾之","role":"Grey, Transformed (v